The [[Mana Potion]] is a [[Potion]] normally obtained by combining the [[Health Potion]] with a [[Blueberries]]. Other than the fact that it doesn't cleanse {{icon/poison}}, it's more-or-less a strict upgrade of the [[Health Potion]], since it gives more max health (which is better than normal healing) than the [[Health Potion]] heals. It also gives 4 {{icon/mana}}, which can be useful if there are other items which utilize it. Since it triggers on {{icon/mana}} used, it can also be used to trigger other [[Potion]]s early in the fight.

The [[Mana Potion]] can be upgraded to the [[Strong Mana Potion]] using a [[Cauldron]], if the player is a [[Reaper]].

The [[Mana Potion]] can be combined with a [[Torch]] to create the much more powerful [[Magic Torch]], although it does require {{icon/mana}} to use its powerful effect.
